      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-07T13:43:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This creates the copy eagerly, even if it turns out to be unused. It is probably ok because if the exclude list is not empty, there is likely something to be excluded. But it might be better to create the copy only on demand. I\u0027m not suggesting to rework the patch as it would complicate the code and exclusion is very rare.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 452,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 452,
        "endChar": 59
      },
      "revId": "2be66d6ad74c6bddaf64f960de3c2a727d647d82",
