        "id": 1039338
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-07T14:58:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only creating the copy on demand is, as you said, much more complicated. Given that we\u0027re only talking about a small array and this code will only run for a very small number of modules, out of tens of thousands, and those modules will exclude some libraries the performance impact of this code will be very small, the benefit from reducing that impact would be even smaller.",
